1294051438960511", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619751_1294051442293844_8154713239817790874_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NBPa8mg9-LAQ7kNvwFeV0JG&_nc_oc=AdoEFDJEABU_eUK0OhYML-eRyX6_GZDXwdrcQ5lQezMjGHN7POSTUfSbODWCokf-7O0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTe4qT6UF88d4YELjkmRL4HrPo1Qo9RHk_tRFShvW9i2w&oe=6AFB39AD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image Trailer.png", "id": "965261262669942", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_965261266003275_4119045274853098971_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vuvQk4aSEEYQ7kNvwG-mden&_nc_oc=Ado6pZk7Wew9d55eb1tS5LlMsyw4plQBWjlI8t1xLnA3cJuqAuvpMr9DZkhpJjFWbxM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRy9SABF_GDxVvqhwOM7lTWiUHJkte1GwNHLfP4PJiKpQ&oe=6AFB2EC5"}, "display_name": "A Trav\u00e9s del Iris", "keywords": ["Narrativa", "Exploraci\u00f3n", "Memoria", "Aventura", "Personal"], "long_description": "Revive tus recuerdos y descubre que cambi\u00f3 en ti.\n\nA trav\u00e9s del Iris es una experiencia narrativa que explora la memoria, la identidad y la introspecci\u00f3n emocional a trav\u00e9s del color, la narraci\u00f3n ambiental y la interacci\u00f3n.\n\nEn un espacio personal e \u00edntimo, los jugadores descubren fragmentos de la historia al interactuar con objetos cotidianos, sutiles pistas visuales y atm\u00f3sferas cambiantes. En lugar de basarse en una acci\u00f3n trepidante, la experiencia invita al descubrimiento pausado, la observaci\u00f3n y la interpretaci\u00f3n. El entorno evoluciona con cada interacci\u00f3n, transformando la forma en que el jugador percibe el espacio.\n\nCerrar los ojos con \"Blink-to-Think\" desencadena momentos de reflexi\u00f3n y sutiles transiciones narrativas, haciendo que la quietud forme parte de la progresi\u00f3n. \n\nUn juego de Sebastian Carrasco.", "short_description": "Una experiencia narrativa en VR donde la memoria, la identidad y el color construyen un viaje \u00edntimo de reflexi\u00f3n, interacci\u00f3n y descubrimiento emocional."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Game Icon.png", "id": "1607505360556230", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673625994_1607505367222896_1574350596834126161_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W1uwwNwiKc8Q7kNvwFCGa9o&_nc_oc=AdrswCBDjX3WVKITZbJKOSIYszx64aqR7y4cB7yUb4G3Hg1cYZ7C6ED-5qTmmrvJwqI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqQqA5LvtmK2g3291x2Z7eWL8xFBR4x_NGudeFWUV15A&oe=6AFB445A"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1459118102347778", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_1459118105681111_1176602155369088893_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RAtrdPNa0DMQ7kNvwEUpPOA&_nc_oc=AdqSdf_8muBbRFBA3gOG-qH8CY-MLtvP3newfLbPLJditJ-6ZIe35YrUX-mgOlOe9E8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5xJNK0W3ZGspaZxOekebVfYjbavGsw9QUUQ5t2Obgew&oe=6AFB1E6F"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "1327050222649759", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298137_1327050225983092_2181195551602462942_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0_kf2G6gnzMQ7kNvwFVGs_L&_nc_oc=Adqh5AVxtML5-fugOF0r0xBS_w5Q1HitUXHd1m5qHtQ-YNe27NoQOZU-4bBhVPFGYM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRVhdretRBcrPlVgEMweHNWmPRXN_V6Da8rINcfQ2tzw&oe=6AFB2F9D"}, {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "973518925187618", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_973518928520951_3852690785809695379_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jj49